{"title":"1976 AHSME Problems/Problem 17","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_17\">Problem 17</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_AHSME_Problems/Problem_17&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 17\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/2/e/52e8ed7a3ba22130ad3984eb2cd413406475a689.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\theta$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> is an acute angle, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/e/8/7e8ba82eedb83cbd1bbb6fca4f4006badd3d19de.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sin 2\\theta=a$\" width=\"77\" height=\"13\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/d/2/dd2f807be704159bc2691dbe50f4832b409380c0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sin\\theta+\\cos\\theta$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"92\" height=\"14\" /> equals\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/6/b/e6bc65b1a328d5d166b78bdc2ffff816d44f1474.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) }\\sqrt{a+1}\\qquad \\textbf{(B) }(\\sqrt{2}-1)a+1\\qquad \\textbf{(C) }\\sqrt{a+1}-\\sqrt{a^2-a}\\qquad\\\\ \\textbf{(D) }\\sqrt{a+1}+\\sqrt{a^2-a}\\qquad  \\textbf{(E) }\\sqrt{a+1}+a^2-a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"481\" height=\"44\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_AHSME_Problems/Problem_17&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/5/3/4530e3d7aabe64e62b18dce5e82a02c1badaaf3f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = \\sin\\theta+\\cos\\theta$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"127\" height=\"14\" />, so we want to find <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />. First, square the expression to get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/e/f5eaecd2dd874031145b5ce71086ee565438a067.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2 = \\sin^2 \\theta + 2\\sin\\theta\\cos\\theta + \\cos^2 \\theta$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"257\" height=\"17\" />. Recall that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/0/a/10a5786b65663e55e2330a47ecf32b4d8666d9e2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sin^2 \\theta + \\cos^2 \\theta = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"143\" height=\"19\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/3/6/53697efd90def229928d0dacd57d3308d3c69938.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sin 2\\theta = 2\\sin\\theta\\cos\\theta$\" width=\"153\" height=\"13\" />. Plugging these in, the equation simplifies to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/a/7/da747fe459950158c79447d7aedb8a0ea7bfe1fd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2 = 1 + \\sin 2\\theta$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"116\" height=\"16\" />. Given that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/e/8/7e8ba82eedb83cbd1bbb6fca4f4006badd3d19de.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sin 2\\theta=a$\" width=\"77\" height=\"13\" />, the equation becomes <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/c/9/ac9ecd2543e0a57ab80e9574ce8bad07038d7b88.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2=1+a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"85\" height=\"18\" />. Take the square root of both sides to get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/5/6/05620ff53573724fdcb96f249a7e87a15e48c9ec.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = \\sqrt{1+a}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"91\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p><p>Hence, the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/e/b/8eb44be47483eeedddf26ac2149873f0064768bc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(A) }\\sqrt{a+1}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"103\" height=\"32\" /> ~<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php/User:Jiang147369\">jiang147369</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_AHSME_Problems/Problem_17&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_AHSME\" title=\"1976 AHSME\">1976 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1976 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1976 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1976\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_AHSME_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"1976 AHSME Problems/Problem 16\">Problem 16</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_AHSME_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"1976 AHSME Problems/Problem 18\">Problem 18</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1976 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1976 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_AHS